          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a get-ready-with-me about fashion trends.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with a ring light on axis for flat, modern, shadowless coverage and grade to a sun-bleached grade with faded blacks and a green-yellow bias.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
